{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S07和S13对人物动机及最终立场的交代压缩得比较狠，尤其没有明确说出他不愿为了留住谁再吞下委屈，X在这方面更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点词句突出每段叙事的核心转折，感受又随音乐进程分批出现，普通观众更容易在听音乐时抓住屏幕重点，不必同时处理一大堆并列信息。它的感受描写也明显更细，既有身体反应、情绪变化，又有音色、节奏、旋律和力度的具体差异，不只是给情绪贴标签。X的优势是人物为什么这样想、前后如何一步步走到最后的决定，交代得更完整，尤其S07和S13，所以综合即时观看体验我选Y，但不是说Y在叙事完整性上也胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "71e7f3b7-37f2-4ba6-9e7f-a2960ac6e903", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T133219875996Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T13:33:42.363235+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37ecba346c5a03d63ba1785de51462e0ff7231ad82c651487828f40052faf432", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "to